5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let’s pick a destination that works for everyone. I’m worried about the cost hitting some members harder than others.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry the year-groups barely talk outside practice. Where we stay decides who spends evenings together.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I’m concerned about the workload. Last year’s organizers lost a month to arrangements and spent the camp on duty.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know what the nights and days would actually be like. Half of us slept badly last time, and it ruined the final day","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
